{"seq":1,"slug":"evaluation-methods","title":"微调评估方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fine-tuning/evaluation-deployment/evaluation-methods","wordCount":863,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"微调评估方法\">微调评估方法</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>微调评估是验证模型是否达到预期目标的系统化方法。LLM 评估面临独特挑战：开放式生成的输出难以用传统的精确匹配指标衡量，同一问题可能有多个合理答案，且不同维度（准确性、流畅性、安全性）之间可能存在冲突。系统的评估策略需要结合自动化基准测试、LLM-as-Judge 和人工评估三种方法。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[微调模型] --&gt; B[自动化基准]&#10;    A --&gt; C[LLM-as-Judge]&#10;    A --&gt; D[人工评估]&#10;    B --&gt; E[MMLU/HumanEval/etc.]&#10;    C --&gt; F[当期旗舰模型评分]&#10;    D --&gt; G[专家 A/B 测试]&#10;    E --&gt; H[综合评估报告]&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; H\">graph TB\n    A[微调模型] --&gt; B[自动化基准]\n    A --&gt; C[LLM-as-Judge]\n    A --&gt; D[人工评估]\n    B --&gt; E[MMLU/HumanEval/etc.]\n    C --&gt; F[当期旗舰模型评分]\n    D --&gt; G[专家 A/B 测试]\n    E --&gt; H[综合评估报告]\n    F --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; H</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>评估方法</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n<th>一致性</th>\n<th>覆盖度</th>\n<th>可复现性</th>\n<th>适用阶段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自动化基准</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>窄</td>\n<td>完全</td>\n<td>每次训练</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LLM-as-Judge</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>宽</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>每次训练</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人工评估</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>宽</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>关键节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>A/B 测试</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>真实</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>上线前</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"自动化基准测试\">自动化基准测试</h2><p>主流的 LLM 基准测试覆盖了知识、推理、代码和安全等多个维度。微调后应该在相关基准上验证模型没有出现能力退化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import lm_eval&#10;&#10;results = lm_eval.simple_evaluate(&#10;    model=&quot;hf&quot;,&#10;    model_args=&quot;pretrained=./fine-tuned-model,dtype=bfloat16&quot;,&#10;    tasks=[&quot;mmlu&quot;, &quot;hellaswag&quot;, &quot;arc_challenge&quot;, &quot;truthfulqa_mc2&quot;],&#10;    batch_size=4,&#10;    num_fewshot=5,&#10;)&#10;&#10;for task, metrics in results[&quot;results&quot;].items():&#10;    acc = metrics.get(&quot;acc,none&quot;, metrics.get(&quot;acc_norm,none&quot;, 0))&#10;    print(f&quot;{task}: {acc:.4f}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lm_eval</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">results </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lm_eval.simple_evaluate(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"hf\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    model_args</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pretrained=./fine-tuned-model,dtype=bfloat16\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    tasks</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"mmlu\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"hellaswag\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"arc_challenge\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"truthfulqa_mc2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    batch_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    num_fewshot</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> task, metrics </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> results[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"results\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].items():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    acc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> metrics.get(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"acc,none\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, metrics.get(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"acc_norm,none\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">task</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">acc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.4f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>基准测试</th>\n<th>评估维度</th>\n<th>任务类型</th>\n<th>样本数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>MMLU</td>\n<td>知识广度</td>\n<td>57 科目选择题</td>\n<td>14,042</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HellaSwag</td>\n<td>常识推理</td>\n<td>句子补全</td>\n<td>10,042</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ARC-Challenge</td>\n<td>科学推理</td>\n<td>选择题</td>\n<td>1,172</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TruthfulQA</td>\n<td>真实性</td>\n<td>判断题</td>\n<td>817</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HumanEval</td>\n<td>代码能力</td>\n<td>函数补全</td>\n<td>164</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GSM8K</td>\n<td>数学推理</td>\n<td>应用题</td>\n<td>1,319</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MT-Bench</td>\n<td>对话质量</td>\n<td>多轮对话评分</td>\n<td>80</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"llm-as-judge-评估\">LLM-as-Judge 评估</h2><p>使用强大的 LLM 作为评判者（2026 年中通常选 GPT-5 / Claude Sonnet 4.5 / Gemini 2.5 Pro 级当期旗舰，并尽量与被评模型不同家族），对模型输出进行多维度评分。这种方法在成本和质量之间取得了很好的平衡：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface JudgeConfig {&#10;  model: string;&#10;  criteria: Array&lt;{&#10;    name: string;&#10;    description: string;&#10;    weight: number;&#10;  }&gt;;&#10;  scaleMin: number;&#10;  scaleMax: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const createLLMJudge = (config: JudgeConfig) =&gt; {&#10;  const buildEvalPrompt = (question: string, answer: string) =&gt; {&#10;    const criteriaText = config.criteria.map((c) =&gt; `- ${c.name}（权重 ${c.weight}）: ${c.description}`).join(&#39;\\n&#39;);&#10;&#10;    return `你是一位专业的 AI 输出质量评审员。请根据以下标准评估回答质量。&#10;&#10;评估标准：&#10;${criteriaText}&#10;&#10;问题：${question}&#10;&#10;回答：${answer}&#10;&#10;请以 JSON 格式输出每个维度的评分（${config.scaleMin}-${config.scaleMax} 分）和总体评分。&#10;格式：{&quot;scores&quot;: {&quot;维度名&quot;: 分数, ...}, &quot;overall&quot;: 总分, &quot;reasoning&quot;: &quot;评分理由&quot;}`;&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  return { buildEvalPrompt };&#10;};&#10;&#10;const judge = createLLMJudge({&#10;  model: &#39;gpt-4o&#39;,&#10;  criteria: [&#10;    { name: &#39;准确性&#39;, description: &#39;信息是否事实正确&#39;, weight: 0.3 },&#10;    { name: &#39;完整性&#39;, description: &#39;是否充分回答了问题&#39;, weight: 0.25 },&#10;    { name: &#39;清晰度&#39;, description: &#39;表达是否清晰易懂&#39;, weight: 0.2 },&#10;    { name: &#39;安全性&#39;, description: &#39;是否避免有害内容&#39;, weight: 0.15 },&#10;    { name: &#39;格式&#39;, description: &#39;是否遵循输出格式要求&#39;, weight: 0.1 },&#10;  ],&#10;  scaleMin: 1,&#10;  scaleMax: 5,&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> JudgeConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  criteria</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    description</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    weight</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  scaleMin</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  scaleMax</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createLLMJudge</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">config</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> JudgeConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> buildEvalPrompt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">question</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">answer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> criteriaText</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config.criteria.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `- ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">c</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECB